            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked whether American Express\u2019s agreements affect Mastercard\u2019s or Visa\u2019s ability to set their own fees."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
