            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked whether, absent a horizontal agreement, the case proceeds."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ed895508f34fd62a5a8e3ec666fa26d46100593e95e30c3df99d2489fa055209",
